{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Slime:</strong> Select from 12 unique characters, each with their own special abilities and playstyles. Pick your slime to suit your strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046040/extras/179d742c3c2678490865b3bc684b183b.avif?t=1756213792\" width=1124 height=396 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Multiplayer Action:</strong> Engage in real-time battles against players from around the world. Test your reflexes and outmaneuver your opponents in chaotic, fast-paced matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046040/extras/8d2e0dedb9e39ce34f328f3f3b711fbf.poster.avif?t=1756213792\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046040/extras/8d2e0dedb9e39ce34f328f3f3b711fbf.webm?t=1756213792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Hell Madness:</strong> Dodge a barrage of bullets while unleashing your own! Stay on your toes, anticipate your enemies' moves, and unleash devastating attacks to defeat your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1046040/extras/a5a343c5feccd160f496bd15941c741f.poster.avif?t=1756213792\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a